---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import TopNav from '../components/TopNav.astro';
---

<Base
  title="About — Sebastian Rogala"
  description="Independent product engineer with over a decade of broad software engineering experience, fully AI-directed since early 2026."
>
  <TopNav current="about" />

  <main class="frame">
    <header class="page-header">
      <div class="eyebrow">About</div>
      <h1>Sebastian Rogala</h1>
      <p class="lede">
        Independent AI-native product engineer. Over a decade of broad software engineering
        experience. After a personal/family pause through end of 2025, fully AI-directed since
        early 2026. Based in Rzeszów, Poland.
      </p>
    </header>

    <section class="content">
      <h2>How I work now</h2>
      <p>
        I am not looking for a classic senior developer role centred on manual code production. My
        leverage is designing AI-directed delivery systems: turning product intent into structured
        specs, decomposing work for agents, building verification loops, and validating shipped
        outcomes. My core principle: <strong>AI failures are spec gaps, not agent shortcomings.</strong>
        I improve delivery by encoding failure modes structurally — through tests, review agents,
        audit tools, hooks, durable state, and source-cited knowledge.
      </p>

      <h2>Currently building</h2>
      <ul class="building">
        <li>Education SaaS — multi-tenant platform, launch customer in production</li>
        <li>Pipeforge — Claude Code orchestration</li>
        <li>ProfitOfExile — community tool</li>
        <li>Open-source contributions</li>
      </ul>
      <p>
        Details, screenshots, and the architectural-enforcement layers at
        <a href="/projects">/projects</a>.
      </p>

      <h2>Speaking</h2>
      <ul class="speaking">
        <li>
          <a href="https://www.meetup.com/rg-dev/events/314750399" target="_blank" rel="noopener">rg-dev
          Meetup</a>, 27.05.2026 — <em>From Prompting to Directing Agents</em>
        </li>
        <li>
          Xebia Internal Conference, Nov 2023 — <em>GitHub Actions &amp; Continuous Delivery on
          Shared Hosting</em>
        </li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Availability</h2>
      <p>
        Available for AI-native engineering roles, advisory engagements, and team workshops on
        context engineering and AI-directed delivery. The workflow is usually the unfamiliar part —
        happy to walk through it.
      </p>

      <h2>Reach</h2>
      <ul class="reach">
        <li><a href="mailto:sebrogala@gmail.com">sebrogala@gmail.com</a></li>
        <li><a href="https://linkedin.com/in/sebrogala" target="_blank" rel="noopener">linkedin.com/in/sebrogala</a></li>
        <li><a href="https://github.com/SebRogala" target="_blank" rel="noopener">github.com/SebRogala</a></li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <footer class="page-footer">
      <a href="/">← back home</a>
      <span class="sep">·</span>
      <a href="/projects">Projects →</a>
    </footer>
  </main>
</Base>

<style>
  .frame {
    max-width: 1140px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 48px 32px;
  }
  /* Content blocks span the full frame width (matching Home). If specific
     long-form paragraphs need narrower line lengths for readability, cap
     them individually — not at the section level. */

  /* Topnav lives in src/components/TopNav.astro. */
  /* `.sep` is also used in the page footer below — keep as page-level rule. */
  .sep {
    color: var(--rule-2);
  }

  .page-header {
    margin-bottom: 36px;
  }
  .eyebrow {
    font-family: var(--mono);
    font-size: 11.5px;
    color: var(--muted);
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    margin-bottom: 18px;
  }
  h1 {
    font-family: var(--serif);
    font-weight: 500;
    font-size: 44px;
    line-height: 1.1;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    color: var(--fg);
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }
  .lede {
    font-family: var(--serif);
    font-weight: 500;
    font-size: 19px;
    line-height: 1.55;
    color: var(--fg);
    text-wrap: pretty;
  }

  .content {
    border-top: 1px solid var(--rule);
    padding-top: 32px;
    font-family: var(--sans);
    font-size: 15.5px;
    line-height: 1.65;
    color: var(--fg);
  }
  .content h2 {
    font-family: var(--serif);
    font-weight: 500;
    font-size: 22px;
    color: var(--fg);
    margin: 32px 0 14px;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
  }
  .content h2:first-child {
    margin-top: 0;
  }
  .content p {
    margin-bottom: 14px;
    text-wrap: pretty;
  }
  .content strong {
    color: var(--fg);
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  .content em {
    color: var(--muted);
    font-style: italic;
  }
  .content code {
    font-family: var(--mono);
    font-size: 13px;
    color: var(--fg-nav);
    background: var(--bg-raise);
    padding: 1px 5px;
    border-radius: 3px;
  }
  .content a {
    color: var(--accent);
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-underline-offset: 3px;
    text-decoration-color: rgba(125, 179, 108, 0.4);
  }

  .speaking,
  .building {
    list-style: none;
    padding-left: 0;
    margin-bottom: 14px;
  }
  .speaking li,
  .building li {
    margin-bottom: 8px;
    padding-left: 16px;
    position: relative;
    text-wrap: pretty;
  }
  .speaking li::before,
  .building li::before {
    content: '·';
    position: absolute;
    left: 2px;
    color: var(--muted);
  }
  .speaking li:last-child,
  .building li:last-child {
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  .reach {
    font-family: var(--mono);
    font-size: 13.5px;
    list-style: none;
    padding-left: 0;
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }
  .reach li {
    margin-bottom: 6px;
  }

  .page-footer {
    margin-top: 48px;
    padding-top: 22px;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--rule);
    font-family: var(--mono);
    font-size: 13px;
    display: flex;
    gap: 12px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }
  .page-footer a {
    color: var(--accent);
    transition: color 160ms ease;
  }
  .page-footer a:hover {
    color: var(--fg);
  }

  @media (max-width: 720px) {
    .frame {
      padding: 36px 22px;
    }

    h1 {
      font-size: 32px;
    }
    .lede {
      font-size: 16px;
    }
    .content h2 {
      font-size: 19px;
    }
    .content {
      font-size: 14.5px;
    }
  }
</style>
